cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this pipeline, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "ngspipeline: Perturb-seq raw reads to ALIVE-ready h5ad"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Jae Min
    family-names: Yoon
abstract: >-
  Nextflow DSL2 pipeline for 10x Genomics Perturb-seq: FASTQ to gene-expression and
  sgRNA count matrices (kallisto|bustools, kb kite), per-cell guide assignment
  (threshold or mixture) and an AnnData h5ad ready for ALIVE.
keywords:
  - Perturb-seq
  - CRISPR screen
  - single-cell RNA-seq
  - Nextflow
  - kallisto
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/jam-sudo/ngspipeline"
